Paste whatever you collected here — the class spreadsheet column, header and
timestamps included, or a chat log with names mixed in. It does not need
cleaning up.

  make addresses     pulls every 0x… (or 0X…), lowercases, dedupes
  make drop          funds them all in ONE transaction (0.05 each)

There is deliberately no address below. A sample address here would be funded
for real by the first person who runs `make drop` on a fresh clone.

  Fulano   0xYOUR-STUDENTS-ADDRESS-GOES-HERE
